{"id":"en_his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups","title":"His Luna Ran Away with Eight Pups","titleEn":"His Luna Ran Away with Eight Pups","description":"Sera, a she-wolf isolated in her marriage to the distant Alpha Caden, discovers she is carrying eight pups. Soon after, she receives both a sum of money and instructions to end the relationship, prompting her to abandon the harsh pack. In time, Caden, filled with regret, sets out to find her and seek forgiveness. Meanwhile, Sera locates her own influential family and begins building a calm new existence, torn between the wounds of her past and the possibility of reconciliation.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5d9a/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5d9a/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5d9a/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5d9a/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-luna-ran-away-with-eight-pups_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5d9a/?pub=